# Working-tree line endings are LF, on every platform, deliberately.
#
# This used to be `* text=auto`, which normalises to LF in the repo but hands Windows a CRLF
# working tree. That breaks two things here:
#
#   1. board/*.board.json has an ENFORCED canonical form (2-space, LF, trailing newline) so that
#      an edit made in the app is a one-line diff instead of a whole-file reformat.
#      `npm run validate:board` fails on CRLF, so a fresh clone on Windows would fail the build.
#   2. Every board file would show as modified the moment the app wrote one, for no real change.
#
# eol=lf makes the checked-out bytes match the checked-in bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these, never diff them as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.otf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip   binary
*.jar   binary
*.exe   binary
*.node  binary
*.aseprite binary
